  "_readme": "Committed GPU ceilings, one entry per harness scene. Generated from a real SwiftShader run with `node scripts/shoot-golf.mjs --update-budgets`; caps are measured \u00d7 1.5 (draw calls, floor 8) and \u00d7 1.4 (triangles, rounded up to 5000). A run exceeding one of these exits non-zero. Raising a cap is a claim that the new cost was measured and is justified \u2014 say so in the commit.",
